   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of social and emotional skills of former street children</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Zlep&#x161;ovanie soci&#xe1;lnych a emocion&#xe1;lnych zru&#x10d;nost&#xed; b&#xfd;val&#xfd;ch det&#xed; ulice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Aktivity dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;&#x10d;ky na mieste bud&#xfa; viacer&#xe9;. 1. Zippyho kamar&#xe1;ti - program pre deti mlad&#x161;ieho &#x161;kolsk&#xe9;ho veku, u&#x10d;&#xed; deti osvoji&#x165; si spr&#xe1;vne soci&#xe1;lne a emocion&#xe1;lne zru&#x10d;nosti 2. Z&#xe1;&#x17e;itkov&#xe9; besedy - pravideln&#xe9; psychologick&#xe9; skupinov&#xe9; poradenstvo pre deti r&#xf4;znej vekovej kateg&#xf3;rie. 3. Individu&#xe1;lne konzult&#xe1;cie - individu&#xe1;lna psychokorekt&#xed;vna &#x10d;innos&#x165; zameran&#xe1; na osobnos&#x165; jednotlivca, na jeho kompletn&#xe9; sebapoznanie a jeho efekt&#xed;vny sebarozvoj. 4. Odborn&#xe9; konzult&#xe1;cie s pedag&#xf3;gmi&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;There are several volunteer activities on site. 1. Zippy&apos;s Friends - A program for younger school children, teaches kids to acquire the right social and emotional skills 2. Interviews - regular psychological group counseling for children of different age categories. 3. Individual consultations - individual psycho-corrective activity focused on the personality of the individual, on his complete self-knowledge and his effective self-development. 4. Professional consultations with educators&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
